---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout title="TERMS OF SERVICE - DJTOBINN">
  <main
    class="w-full min-h-screen bg-[#050505] text-white py-24 sm:py-32 px-6 sm:px-12 flex flex-col gap-16 max-w-5xl mx-auto"
  >
    <div class="border-b border-white/20 pb-8 flex flex-col items-start gap-8">
      <a
        href="/"
        class="font-mono text-[10px] sm:text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-white/50 border border-white/20 px-4 py-2 hover:bg-white hover:text-black hover:border-white transition-all"
      >
        RETURN TO MAIN
      </a>
      <h1
        class="display-text text-5xl sm:text-7xl uppercase tracking-tighter leading-[0.8] m-0"
      >
        TERMS & CONDITIONS
      </h1>
    </div>

    <div
      class="font-sans text-base sm:text-lg leading-relaxed text-white/80 flex flex-col gap-10 font-light"
    >
      <section class="flex flex-col gap-3">
        <h2 class="text-white text-xl sm:text-2xl tracking-tight font-medium">
          1. General Agreement
        </h2>
        <p>
          By accessing this website and utilizing our booking services, you agree to be bound by these terms and conditions. If you do not agree to these terms, disconnect immediately.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="flex flex-col gap-3">
        <h2 class="text-white text-xl sm:text-2xl tracking-tight font-medium">
          2. Booking Protocol
        </h2>
        <p>
          All booking inquiries are subject to availability, scheduling, and final confirmation by management. An inquiry constitutes a request, not a binding contract. Contracts are only valid once formally signed and applicable deposits are cleared.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="flex flex-col gap-3">
        <h2 class="text-white text-xl sm:text-2xl tracking-tight font-medium">
          3. Intellectual Property
        </h2>
        <p>
          All audio, branding, logos, and typographic structures displayed on this site are the intellectual property of DJ Tobinn. Unauthorized reproduction, redistribution, or commercial exploitation is strictly prohibited.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="flex flex-col gap-3">
        <h2 class="text-white text-xl sm:text-2xl tracking-tight font-medium">
          4. Limitation of Liability
        </h2>
        <p>
          We are not liable for any direct, indirect, or incidental damages arising from the use of this website, unavailability of services, or interaction with third-party embeds.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="flex flex-col gap-3 border-t border-white/20 pt-10">
        <h2 class="text-white text-xl sm:text-2xl tracking-tight font-medium">
          Last Update
        </h2>
        <p>
          These terms were last modified in 2026. We reserve the right to update these terms at any time without prior notice.
        </p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </main>
</Layout>
